        <h2>6. Third-Party Services and Integrations</h2>
        <p>The Service integrates with third-party services, including Google Calendar, payment processors, and messaging providers. Your use of those integrations is also subject to the respective third party's terms and policies. The Google Calendar integration is optional; if you connect it, Birdie's handling of Google user data is described in our Privacy Policy.</p>

